cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this release helps your work, cite this repository and Khaled Bakeer's upstream DeepSeek-V4.1 Spark runtime."
title: "DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-Next-DGX-Spark-512K"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A self-contained fixed-expert DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash deployment for one 128 GB
  NVIDIA DGX Spark. The release packages a deterministic K154 CB3-v2 expert
  set, removes the superseded main routed-expert tensors, and is qualified at
  524,293 prompt tokens.
